  "prefLabel": "Nur 101.15 Nursing-related activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 101.15 “Nursing-related activities” means “nursing-related activities” as defined by RSA 326-B:2, VIII, namely, “client care provided by a licensed nursing assistant directed by an APRN, an RN, or an LPN.”\n\nSource. #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13 (from Nur 101.15); ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14 (from Nur 101.15) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Nur 100); renumbered by #13672 (formerly Nur 101.16)",
